---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../styles/history.css';
import {maintenanceBuild} from '../maintenance-history/build.ts';
const view=maintenanceBuild();
---
<Base title="Post-publication review"><header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Human follow-up</p><h1>Review after publication.</h1><p>Valid revisions publish automatically. These flags request follow-up on articles that are already available to read.</p></header><nav class="history-nav" aria-label="Review navigation"><a href="/history/">Revision history</a><a href="/admin/">Editorial workspace</a></nav><section class="history-reading"><h2>Current publication flags</h2><p>This static view records flags at publication. Authenticated review decisions retain a separate audit; they do not remove the original flags or constitute factual approval.</p>{view.reviewQueue.length?<ul class="revision-list">{view.reviewQueue.map(entry=><li><h3><a href="/articles/tool-use/">Tool use</a></h3><p>Automatic maintenance bot · Controlled preview</p><ul>{entry.flags.map(flag=><li>{flag==='editorial-review'?'Editorial review requested':flag.replaceAll('-',' ')}</li>)}</ul><p><a href={`/history/tool-use/${entry.eventId}/`}>Read revision and text changes</a></p><code>{entry.receipt.articleRevision}</code></li>)}</ul>:<p>No maintenance review flags are recorded in this edition. Original drafts retain their separate editorial-review status.</p>}</section></Base>
